        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Gates, in order:&lt;/b&gt; schema validation • drift check • two CODEOWNERS approvals • infra plan approval • security plan approval.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hard dependency:&lt;/b&gt; the security stack cannot plan until the infra stack has applied and published its outputs, and both stacks must live in the same TFC project." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
